From 2742f9c4596fa2276ecee7f40cf6abbe36acc2a5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Mar 2026 16:57:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 182/913] clk: stm32mp25: make RIF configuration not mandatory

The presence of a RIF configuration is not mandatory. Simply put a
trace to inform that RIF will not be configured. While there, refactor
the error handling in the stm32mp2_clk_probe() function to fix memory
leaks.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git cf58f663976dfa93cbc8edb4baedf00422e719ea clk: stm32mp25: make RIF configuration not mandatory]
Change-Id: I24cafcc4c867d5e0c1cf64bcc30627602d93a518
Signed-off-by: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/409998
